# Rust / Cargo build output
/target

# Cargo backup files from edition migrations
**/*.rs.bk

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is committed on purpose — this is a binary crate, so a
# lockfile gives anyone who clones it a reproducible build of the exact deps
# (including the woofwoof / Google-woff2 FFI). The `samples/` fonts are also
# committed so the browser demo works with no build step.
